    TestContext.<anonymous> (file:///Users/arata/Library/Mobile%20Documents/com%7Eapple%7ECloudDocs/claude%20code%20files/show-creative-ideas/shosai-app/tests/stage-prop-shapes.test.mjs:75:10)
